    <h1>How Ambient Stable Coffee Kegs Help You Save More Money</h1>
    <p class="muted">By John Goerke. <time datetime="2020-08-22">August 22, 2020</time> (updated <time datetime="2020-08-24">August 24, 2020</time>).</p>

    <h2>Lockdown: Cafes and Coffee Shop Owners Losing Money</h2>
    <p>During the COVID-19 closures, many cafes and coffee shops were unable to serve customers, and coffee and other perishable stock that needed refrigeration was spoiled and wasted. That was lost money on top of lost sales.</p>

    <h2>Ambient Stable Coffee Kegs</h2>
    <p>Ambient stable coffee kegs do not depend on refrigerated storage, which reduces the exposure to spoilage and can reduce waste and cost. Read more about <a href="/nitro-coffee-kegs/">nitro coffee kegs</a>, or <a href="/contact-bona-fide-nitro-coffee-and-tea/">contact us</a> to talk about what would suit your business.</p>
